<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #f4f7fb;
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        color: #2d3748;
      }
      .email-container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 30px auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(14, 14, 82, 0.08);
      }
      .email-header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0e0e52 0%, #150578 50%, #192bc2 100%);
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 30px 25px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .email-logo {
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
      }
      .email-sublogo {
        font-size: 12px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #78c0e0;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .email-body {
        padding: 30px 25px;
      }
      .status-pill {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #fffbeb;
        color: #92400e;
        border: 1px solid #fde68a;
        padding: 6px 14px;
        border-radius: 50px;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 13px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }
      .email-title {
        color: #0e0e52;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 800;
        margin: 0 0 10px 0;
      }
      .email-text {
        color: #5e6e82;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0 0 25px 0;
      }
      .details-card {
        background-color: #f8fafc;
        border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        border-left: 4px solid #449dd1;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 25px;
      }
      .detail-label {
        color: #5e6e82;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .detail-value {
        color: #0e0e52;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .email-footer {
        background-color: #0e0e52;
        color: #ffffff;
        opacity: 0.9;
        padding: 20px 25px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="email-container">
      <div class="email-header">
        <div class="email-logo">⚽ CANCHA TURNOS</div>
        <div class="email-sublogo">Fútbol 5 Sintético</div>
      </div>

      <div class="email-body">
        <div class="status-pill">
          ⏳ Solicitud Recibida
        </div>

        <h1 class="email-title">Hemos recibido tu solicitud de reserva</h1>
        <p class="email-text">
          Tu solicitud fue registrada en el sistema. Una vez acreditada la seña o validado el turno por el administrador, recibirás la confirmación definitiva.
        </p>

        <div class="details-card">
          <table width="100%" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0">
            <tr>
              <td class="detail-label">Cancha solicitada:</td>
              <td class="detail-value" align="right">
                ⚽ <%= @court ? @court.name : "Cancha F5" %>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="detail-label">Fecha:</td>
              <td class="detail-value" align="right">
                📅 <%= @reservation.date ? @reservation.date.strftime("%d/%m/%Y") : "--" %>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="detail-label">Horario:</td>
              <td class="detail-value" align="right">
                ⏱️ <%= @time_slot ? "#{@time_slot.day_name} #{@time_slot.formatted_time_range}" : "--" %>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="detail-label">N° de Solicitud:</td>
              <td class="detail-value" align="right">
                #<%= @reservation.id %>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="email-footer">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0;"><strong>Cancha Turnos · Complejo Deportivo</strong></p>
        <p style="margin: 0; color: #78c0e0;">Av. del Deporte 1250 · Tel / WhatsApp: +54 9 11 0000-0000</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
